This archive contains Ultimate ReqCheck.
Please direct any questions to one of the maintainers and/or consult the
websites.

Websites:
<https://github.com/ultimate-pa/ultimate>
<https://ultimate.informatik.uni-freiburg.de/>

Maintainers:
